WEBVTT

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:02.995
Bonafide

00:00:02.995 --> 00:00:07.535
No luck, no loss

00:00:07.535 --> 00:00:11.853
No price, no cost

00:00:11.853 --> 00:00:15.503
Just another baby love

00:00:15.503 --> 00:00:18.240
With a mama

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:23.080
And a mother somewhere

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.800
And new life, new precious delights

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:28.440
Everywhere

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:31.640
When the grass was green

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:39.335
And my next life was unforeseen

00:00:39.335 --> 00:00:43.785
Now in a sandbox

00:00:43.785 --> 00:00:48.053
Perimeters of chains

00:00:48.053 --> 00:00:50.898
Tiny hands

00:00:50.898 --> 00:00:55.710
Endless reasons to dance

00:00:55.710 --> 00:01:00.230
Boundless places to prance

00:01:00.230 --> 00:01:03.310
Curly hair to play in

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:06.960
That's the moment I want to stay in

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:08.660
Dream of a land

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:14.600
My soul is strong

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:26.380
I hear a hit stroke on a drum

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:29.840
Of delight

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:33.840
Coco cue

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:42.067
Rich as the night

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:46.520
Afro blue
